on CUDA/HIP the untuned plan seeds a contraction and splits a reduction: true
off CUDA/HIP the untuned compile is the plain default: true
off CUDA/HIP the search derives no seeded plan: true
the search's first candidate is the seeded untuned plan: true
its timed code is the untuned compile's, segment for segment: true
the search went on to time later candidates, every one of them refused: true
the search crowned the seeded plan, its reading the report's seeded_ms and best_ms: true
the crowned gradients are bitwise the untuned compile's: true
the control: the plain default pipeline's bias gradient differs in some cell: true
a refused seeded window is retried after the seed pass: true
